","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" if this entity is destroyed or lacks one of the components; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" is not called then."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The read components are passed as copies, the written ones are changed in place in the nexus (see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Entity\/modify(_:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"): ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" receives the read components first, then the written ones as "},{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing runs if the entity lacks one of the components. A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" event is delivered for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written component. The written types must differ from each other, else the access traps. Overloads exist for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"0 to 4 read and 0 to 4 written types, and a parameter pack overload covers more."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["entity.components(Velocity.self, writing: Position.self) { velocity, position in","    position.x += velocity.dx","}"]}]}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ReadingAndWritingComponents":{"type":"topic